{"id":"658020","name":"松茸焖鸡","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/658020/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"干松茸","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡肉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"姜片","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"适量干松茸备用。","img":"images/658020/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加入清水提前泡发洗净。","img":"images/658020/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"鸡肉斩块后擦干水份。","img":"images/658020/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入适量玉米淀粉，盐，蚝油，老抽。","img":"images/658020/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"抓拌均匀腌制半小时左右。","img":"images/658020/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"锅中热油放入鸡肉。","img":"images/658020/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"中小火煎至金黄。","img":"images/658020/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入松茸。","img":"images/658020/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"翻炒均匀炒出香味。","img":"images/658020/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加入适量清水煮开。","img":"images/658020/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"盖上小火焖15至20分钟。","img":"images/658020/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"汤汁有多再适当收一下汁即可。","img":"images/658020/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/658020/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/658020/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/658020/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}